\n\nA casa possui 2 vagas de garagem cobertas mais 2 vagas descobertas.\n\nSe esse imóvel é o que sua família necessita, entre agora em contato conosco e agende sua visita!\n\nCasa de condomínio no bairro Campo Comprido.\nCom 303 m² privativos, possui 4 quartos sendo 4 suítes e 2 vaga de garagem.","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a554008b4c9f82b8c7dca91/pilar-homes-images-watermark/4ba2e7bb-a4c6-4b24-a0ef-cbd3b169b88c.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a554008b4c9f82b8c7dca91/pilar-homes-images-watermark/abd64664-b9a3-40b1-bd4e-31dc4f3cb5e4.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a554008b4c9f82b8c7dca91/pilar-homes-images-watermark/32d2089e-4734-44a1-aa8e-8d91bea8a573.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a554008b4c9f82b8c7dca91/pilar-homes-images-watermark/72b3b376-a6ce-489e-a0ab-9e141d9a0eaf.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a554008b4c9f82b8c7dca91/pilar-homes-images-watermark/39229f2c-57fb-4da6-b0e9-a5358d6f43f1.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a554008b4c9f82b8c7dca91/pilar-homes-images-watermark/3f09f8c4-7e5f-4aa6-b24a-3070d9f75bdd.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a554008b4c9f82b8c7dca91/pilar-homes-images-watermark/273604f5-ff96-4078-8340-32ece564055d.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a554008b4c9f82b8c7dca91/pilar-homes-images-watermark/5d71f31e-7715-47f9-af9f-150529fb4492.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a554008b4c9f82b8c7dca91/pilar-homes-images-watermark/cb47deb0-2a7c-4c3c-9fc0-54048413456f.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a554008b4c9f82b8c7dca91/pilar-homes-images-watermark/0df19693-af9f-4e03-b9f1-368790fe325a.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a554008b4c9f82b8c7dca91/pilar-homes-images-watermark/6dc8aeec-219f-44f2-9078-7a9197194266.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6